# Route: guide 41 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 59, 59 quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Burning Steppes, Loch Modan, Hillsbrad Foothills, Alterac
# Mountains, Durotar, Un'Goro Crater): Gadgetzan -> Steamwheedle Port ->
# Gadgetzan -> Broken Pillar -> Gadgetzan -> Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan ->
# Ruins of Thaurissan -> Dreadmaul Rock -> Ruins of Thaurissan ->
# Stonesplinter Valley -> Stonewrought Dam -> Tarren Mill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Necklace Recovery (2283;
# Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger
# 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave
# Hunter 36-37); The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge Mauler 36-37); The Crown
# of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll
# Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The
# Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), Precarious
# Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg Freezing (4734),
# Egg Collection (4735), The Grave Knight (96986), Heart of Disruption
# (96984), The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987).

